    <div class="wpd-comment-link wpd-hidden">
    <span wpd-tooltip='Comment Link' wpd-tooltip-position='left'><i class='fas fa-link' aria-hidden='true' data-wpd-clipboard='https://www.blackgate.com/2015/04/24/sci-fis-difficult-genius-the-new-yorker-on-gene-wolfe/#comment-98778'></i></span>
</div>
</div>
    <div class="wpd-comment-text">
    <p>I&#8217;d be curious to know where to start with Gene Wolfe. I bought &#8220;Peace&#8221; used many years ago, but never actually read it. I&#8217;ll do a binge on him sooner or later, as he seems like the kind of author I&#8217;d love.</p>

</div>
