    <div class="wpd-comment-link wpd-hidden">
    <span wpd-tooltip='Comment Link' wpd-tooltip-position='left'><i class='fas fa-link' aria-hidden='true' data-wpd-clipboard='https://www.blackgate.com/2015/04/24/sci-fis-difficult-genius-the-new-yorker-on-gene-wolfe/#comment-98822'></i></span>
</div>
</div>
    <div class="wpd-comment-text">
    <p>If you can read the first page of The Shadow of the Torturer and turn back, you&#8217;re made of different material than I am.</p>

</div>
