</div>
</div>
    <div class="wpd-comment-link wpd-hidden">
    <span wpd-tooltip='Comment Link' wpd-tooltip-position='left'><i class='fas fa-link' aria-hidden='true' data-wpd-clipboard='https://www.blackgate.com/2015/04/24/sci-fis-difficult-genius-the-new-yorker-on-gene-wolfe/#comment-98863'></i></span>
</div>
</div>
    <div class="wpd-comment-text">
    <p>Wow. Sarah, without knowing any of the people you describe, may I suggest that the problem may lie more with the describers than the work being described? I found the Book of the New Sun to be a deeply humane and moral work.</p>

</div>
